        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful. What is the Okanagan Valley in British Columbia and is this a good place to spend some free time?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is the Okanagan Valley in British Columbia and is this a good place to spend some free time?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The Okanagan Valley in British Columbia is a stunning region known for its vineyards, warm climate, and diverse recreational activities. It\u2019s one of the warmest areas in Canada, offering sandy beaches, outdoor adventures, and water activities during the summer. The valley is also home to Okanagan Lake, a popular spot for relaxation and scenic views. Kelowna, the largest city in the region, combines a vibrant urban atmosphere with access to nature, making it a great base for exploring the area. If you enjoy wine, the Okanagan Valley is a must-visit, as it\u2019s the heart of British Columbia\u2019s wine country. With its picturesque landscapes and variety of activities, it\u2019s definitely a fantastic place to spend your free time!",
