          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful! Which of these\u2014Sauvignon Blanc, Terruzi & Puthod Terre di Tufi, or Domaine Pascal Cotat Sancerre La Grande Cote\u2014would be easiest on the stomach if someone sometimes gets acid reflux?",
