          "text": "For lighter meals and your health goals, the herbal/grassy white wines we discussed\u2014Sauvignon Blanc, Gr\u00fcner Veltliner, Albari\u00f1o, and Verdejo\u2014are excellent, versatile pairings:\n\n**Why They Work for Lighter Meals:**\n- **Sauvignon Blanc:** Pairs beautifully with salads, grilled chicken, white fish, shellfish, and dishes with fresh herbs or goat cheese. Its herbal notes enhance green vegetables and light proteins.\n- **Gr\u00fcner Veltliner:** Exceptionally food-friendly; great with salads, vegetable dishes (even tricky ones like asparagus and artichokes), cold meats, and light fish. Its peppery, herbal edge complements Asian-inspired or herb-driven plates.\n- **Albari\u00f1o:** Ideal with seafood, ceviche, grilled fish, and light Mediterranean fare. Its freshness and subtle salinity lift delicate flavors.\n- **Verdejo:** Matches well with grilled fish, chicken, and vegetable-forward dishes. Its grassy notes echo fresh herbs and greens.\n\n**Personalized Fit:**\n- All are dry (low sugar), light",
