        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking for some wine suggestions. Can you help?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some wine suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "A glass of wine in the evening can be very relaxing. For a good night's sleep, I'd recommend a wine with a lower acidity and tannin level. You might enjoy a smooth Merlot or a rich, full-bodied Cabernet Franc. Both of these varieties are known for their calming effects and are gentle on the stomach, which is a bonus given your mild acid reflux. Would you like more specific recommendations or wine and food pairing suggestions?",
