          "user_utterance": "Nice, thanks! What is the Okanagan Valley in British Columbia and is this a good place to spend some free time?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is the Okanagan Valley in British Columbia and is this a good place to spend some free time?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The Okanagan Valley in British Columbia, Canada, is a region known for its dry, sunny climate, stunning scenery of mountains and lakes, and as a premier wine-producing area. It's an excellent place for leisure and recreation, offering numerous outdoor activities like hiking, boating, and watersports. For skiing enthusiasts, it boasts popular ski resorts such as Silver Star Mountain Resort and has two major ski resorts in total, making it ideal for trying new activities.",
