          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking for some wine suggestions. Can you help?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some wine suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "sure \u2014 a few quick options depending on what you like or are serving. tell me which sounds closest and i \u2019 ll refine. reds - cabernet sauvignon : rich, great with steak or burgers. - pinot noir : lighter, good with salmon, mushrooms, or bbq sausages. - zinfandel / grenache blends : jammy and spicy \u2014 excellent with burgers and smoky bbq. - malbec or syrah / shiraz : bold choices for grilled red meats. whites - chardonnay ( warmer - climate ) : richer, pairs well with bbq chicken or creamy dishes. - sauvignon blanc : crisp, great with salads, goat cheese, or shellfish. - riesling ( off - dry ) : bright with spicy or asian - flavored dishes. - pinot grigio / pinot gris : light and versatile with fish and lighter pastas. rose & sparkling - light dry rose ( provence style ) : superb with salads, seafood, and hot - weather drinking. - sparkling / champagne or rose champagne : perfect with salmon or celebratory meals. tell me the meal, style ( dry / fruit",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0040-11-07753:0": 42.14310073852539,
