    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice, thanks! What is the Okanagan Valley in British Columbia and is this a good place to spend some free time?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is the Okanagan Valley in British Columbia and is this a good place to spend some free time?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The Okanagan Valley (British Columbia) is a sun\u2011drenched lake valley known as Canada\u2019s \u201cwine country\u201d \u2014 often called the \u201cNapa of the North.\u201d It runs roughly 60 miles with Okanagan Lake down the middle; Kelowna is the main city. Since the 1990s growers planted European varieties, and today the region has well over 200 wineries producing everything from cool\u2011climate Pinot/Chardonnay and Riesling in the north to fuller Cabernet/Syrah styles in the warmer south (around Osoyoos).  Is it a good place to spend free time? Absolutely. It\u2019s ideal for a short getaway or longer holiday: - Summer/fall: wine tasting and tours, beaches and boating, hiking, golf (dozens of courses).   - Winter: nearby ski resorts and snowy mountains.   - Dining, lakeside resorts, and warm microclimates (Osoyoos even has Canada\u2019s only hot desert).  Getting there: about a 4\u20135 hour drive from Vancouver or ~1 hour by plane to Kelowna. Great for food, wine, outdoors, and relaxation.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0024-55-13814:0": 35.34619903564453,
            "clueweb22-en0036-52-14429:0": 31.841800689697266,
            "clueweb22-en0004-57-15420:2": 30.77829933166504,
            "clueweb22-en0041-48-17728:8": 30.693199157714844,
            "clueweb22-en0004-57-15420:3": 30.416400909423828
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      }
    ],
    "judgment": {
